    // Prepare type matcher from hardcoded list? We have ignore crate but we use hardcoded for type-list. For actual filtering, we need to map type names to globs.
    // We'll parse TYPE_LIST to build map: type name -> Vec<glob patterns>
    // Then when type filter provided, we check file name matches any of those globs.
